# Tests

- Prefer `pytest -q` / `-q --tb=line`; show failures only.
- Cover core paths: sanitize→vault split, fusion thresholds, fraud gate, claim scoring.
- Mock LLM/MCP at boundaries; do not call live providers in unit tests.
- Target ≥80% on core pipelines/fraud before demo harden sprint.
- No real secrets in fixtures; use `.env.example` shaped fakes.
